---
import SectionHeading from '../ui/SectionHeading.astro';
import Icon from '../ui/Icon.astro';
---

<section class="wrap py-24 sm:py-32">
  <SectionHeading eyebrow="The problem">
    A first week shouldn't be spent <em class="text-sun">asking around.</em>
  </SectionHeading>

  <div class="mt-12 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:mt-16 lg:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-5">
    <article class="reveal rounded-3xl border border-line bg-white p-5 sm:p-6">
      <div aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-44 flex-col justify-center gap-2 rounded-2xl bg-paper-deep p-4">
        <p class="max-w-[85%] self-start rounded-2xl rounded-bl-md bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgb(26_25_24/0.06)]">
          Hi! Who can add me to Linear?
        </p>
        <p class="max-w-[85%] self-start rounded-2xl rounded-bl-md bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgb(26_25_24/0.06)]">
          Also, still no Slack access…
        </p>
        <p class="self-end rounded-2xl rounded-br-md bg-ink/85 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-paper">Ask IT?</p>
      </div>
      <h3 class="mt-6 font-display text-[1.75rem] leading-tight">Access lives in DMs</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
        The new hire asks around for every tool. Someone forgets one. The first week starts with
        waiting.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="reveal rounded-3xl border border-line bg-white p-5 sm:p-6" style="--reveal-delay:100ms">
      <div aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-44 flex-col justify-center rounded-2xl bg-paper-deep p-4">
        <div class="rounded-xl bg-white p-3 shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgb(26_25_24/0.06)]">
          <p class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-line px-2.5 py-1.5 text-sm text-ink-muted">
            <Icon name="search" class="size-4" />
            api keys local setup
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1.5 px-1 font-mono text-xs">
            <li>Local setup (old)</li>
            <li>Local setup v2</li>
            <li class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
              Local setup v2 FINAL
              <span class="rounded bg-sun-soft px-1.5 font-sans text-sun-deep">which one?</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <h3 class="mt-6 font-display text-[1.75rem] leading-tight">Answers are buried</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
        The answer is somewhere: a doc, a wiki page, an old thread. The new hire doesn't know where to
        look, so they ask around or they guess.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="reveal rounded-3xl border border-line bg-white p-5 sm:col-span-2 sm:p-6 lg:col-span-1" style="--reveal-delay:200ms">
      <div aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-44 flex-col justify-center gap-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-paper-deep p-4">
        {
          ['bg-sky', 'bg-butter', 'bg-sage'].map((tone, index) => (
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class:list={['size-6 shrink-0 rounded-full', tone]} />
              <div class="relative h-2 flex-1 rounded-full bg-white">
                <div class="h-full w-[48%] rounded-full bg-ink/25" />
                <span class="absolute top-1/2 left-[48%] grid size-5 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 place-items-center rounded-full bg-white text-[0.6875rem] font-semibold text-sun-deep shadow-[0_1px_3px_rgb(26_25_24/0.15)]">
                  ?
                </span>
              </div>
              <span class="w-12 text-right text-[0.6875rem] text-ink-muted">Hire {index + 1}</span>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
      <h3 class="mt-6 font-display text-[1.75rem] leading-tight">Nobody sees the bottleneck</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
        New hires get stuck at the same step, one after another. The team never finds out.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
